      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "A, B and C are correct; λ describes pair concurrence.",
      "statements": [
        "bk=vr counts all treatment placements.",
        "λ(v−1)=r(k−1) counts co-occurrences for a fixed treatment.",
        "Every treatment occurs in r blocks.",
        "λ is the number of blocks containing one treatment."
      ],
      "verdicts": {
        "A": {
          "tf": true,
          "why": "Placement identity."
        },
        "B": {
          "tf": true,
          "why": "Fix one treatment and count partners."
        },
        "C": {
          "tf": true,
          "why": "Definition of r."
        },
        "D": {
          "tf": false,
          "why": "That count is r; λ is for a pair."
        }
      }
    },
